chargeBatch.t.sol
├── when the caller is not the relayer
│   └── it should revert with the {OnlyRelayer} error
└── when the caller is the relayer
    ├── when the `id` and `amount` arrays have different lengths
    │   └── it should revert with the {ArrayLengthMismatch} error
    └── when the `id` and `amount` arrays have the same length
        ├── it should charge each subscription's next due cycle with the provided amount
        ├── it should transfer the amount from the {Space}s to the treasury
        └── when an item fails 
            ├── it should skip the failing item without reverting the batch
            ├── it should not change the failed item's state
            └── it should charge the rest of the items
